## A2. Fix Strapi Keepalive (Missing proxy_http_version and Connection header)

**File:** `/etc/nginx/sites-enabled/infinitycolor.org` (Strapi location block)

**Problem:** Without `proxy_http_version 1.1`, Nginx defaults to HTTP/1.0 for upstream connections. HTTP/1.0 does not support keepalive at all. The `keepalive 32` on `strapi_upstream` is completely wasted.

**Current (BROKEN):**
```nginx
location / {
    proxy_pass http://strapi_upstream;
    proxy_set_header Host $host;
    # ... NO proxy_http_version, NO Connection header
}
```

**Fix:**
```nginx
location / {
    proxy_pass http://strapi_upstream;
    proxy_http_version 1.1;
    proxy_set_header Connection "";  # Enable keepalive
    proxy_set_header Host $host;
    proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
    proxy_read_timeout 600s;
    proxy_connect_timeout 600s;
    proxy_send_timeout 600s;
    client_max_body_size 20M;

    # Enable response buffering
    proxy_buffering on;
    proxy_buffers 16 16k;
    proxy_buffer_size 16k;
}
```

**Impact:** Eliminates TCP handshake overhead for all API calls (~1-3ms per request).

---

## A3. Enable Gzip for JSON (gzip effectively disabled)

**File:** `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf`

**Problem:** With only `gzip on`, Nginx only compresses `text/html`. JSON API responses (bulk of Strapi traffic) are sent uncompressed. A typical product listing response can be 50-200KB of JSON.

**Current (BROKEN):**
```nginx
gzip on;
# gzip_vary on;          # ALL COMMENTED OUT
# gzip_proxied any;
# gzip_comp_level 6;
# gzip_types text/plain text/css application/json ...;
```

**Fix:**
```nginx
gzip on;
gzip_vary on;
gzip_proxied any;
gzip_comp_level 5;
gzip_min_length 256;
gzip_buffers 16 8k;
gzip_http_version 1.1;
gzip_types
    text/plain
    text/css
    text/xml
    text/javascript
    application/json
    application/javascript
    application/x-javascript
    application/xml
    application/xml+rss
    application/vnd.ms-fontobject
    application/x-font-ttf
    font/opentype
    image/svg+xml;
```

**Impact:** 70-90% reduction in JSON payload sizes. A 100KB product listing becomes ~15KB.

