## A4. Enable proxy_buffering (Currently Disabled on Next.js)

**File:** `/etc/nginx/sites-enabled/infinitycolor.org` (Next.js location block)

**Problem:** With `proxy_buffering off`, Nginx must wait for the client to consume each chunk before requesting more from upstream. This ties up the upstream connection longer than necessary.

**Current (BROKEN):**
```nginx
proxy_buffering off;
```

**Fix:** Remove `proxy_buffering off` (or set to `on`). Add explicit buffer sizes:

```nginx
# Enable buffering for better throughput
proxy_buffering on;
proxy_buffers 16 16k;
proxy_buffer_size 16k;
```

**Impact:** Better throughput under load, reduces connection occupancy time.

---

## A5. Remove Deprecated SSL Protocols (Security)

**File:** `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf`

**Problem:** TLSv1 and TLSv1.1 are deprecated and insecure.

**Current (INSECURE):**
```nginx
ssl_protocols TLSv1 TLSv1.1 TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
```

**Fix:**
```nginx
ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
```

