## Deployment Checklist

- [ ] Backup current Nginx config: `cp /etc/nginx/nginx.conf /etc/nginx/nginx.conf.backup`
- [ ] Backup site config: `cp /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/infinitycolor.org /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/infinitycolor.org.backup`
- [ ] Apply A1 fix (Next.js keepalive)
- [ ] Apply A2 fix (Strapi keepalive)
- [ ] Apply A3 fix (gzip for JSON)
- [ ] Apply A4 fix (proxy_buffering)
- [ ] Apply A5 fix (SSL protocols)
- [ ] Apply B1 (internal server block for Strapi)
- [ ] Test Nginx config: `nginx -t`
- [ ] Reload Nginx: `systemctl reload nginx`
- [ ] Set `STRAPI_INTERNAL_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080/api` in Next.js production environment
- [ ] Restart Next.js instances
- [ ] Monitor logs for errors
- [ ] Run validation checks (connection reuse, gzip, performance)
- [ ] Monitor production metrics for 24 hours

---

## Rollback Plan

If issues occur:

```bash
# Restore backup configs
cp /etc/nginx/nginx.conf.backup /etc/nginx/nginx.conf
cp /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/infinitycolor.org.backup /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/infinitycolor.org

# Test and reload
nginx -t
systemctl reload nginx

# Remove STRAPI_INTERNAL_URL from Next.js env
# Restart Next.js instances
```

